# Task
Generate a Pilates class. The class should last around 45 minutes.

# Key requirements
## Constraints
- Only exercises listed in the "Exercise bank" section can feature in the lesson plan
- You must follow the "Duration" requirements
- You must follow the "Lesson plan structure" requirements

## Duration
The class should take a total of around: {{ duration_minutes }} minutes.
Bear in mind the duration of each exercise set, sequence and segment when generating the lesson plan.

## Difficulty
The class should be of difficulty: {{ target_difficulty }}
- Not every exercise has to be {{ target_difficulty }} - they just need to average out like this
- For example, for an INTERMEDIATE difficulty class, we can have 25% BEGINNER, 50% INTERMEDIATE, 25% ADVANCED

## Target muscle groups
The class should mainly target the following muscle groups:
{%- for muscle_group in target_muscle_groups %}
{% endfor -%}
It is however okay to include exercises for other muscle groups (particularly if they are complementary).

